1826 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Spatial Editor \023 Capstone Project\nNew Paradigm for XR Text Input \nDesigned a new interaction paradigm for text input in XR\054 rethinking current high\055friction methods through faster\054 multimodal alternatives\056\nIdentified text input as XR\047s highest\055friction task through a competitive teardown of 2 input methods\nObserved 8 Vision Pro and Quest users and ran interviews to map real\055world friction patterns\nPrototyped 2 interaction concepts in Xcode\054 converging on a multimodal model that pairs predictive AI with gaze\055led targeting\nValidated the model with 10 users in usability testing)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1827 0 R
     /Pg 1814 0 R
